# ─── NEVER commit secrets or keys ─────────────────────────
# Your Oracle SSH key stays on your PC only. If it ever gets
# pushed, anyone can log into your server — delete it from
# GitHub history immediately AND create a new key pair.
oracle.key
*.key
*.pem
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# Environment files (contain passwords/API keys)
.env
.env.*
*.env

